# Omitted deliberately: a lockfile generated on one OS records only that
# platform's optional binaries (@rollup/rollup-*, @esbuild/*), and npm will
# not backfill the others (npm/cli#4828). Committing one makes Linux CI fail
# with "Cannot find module @rollup/rollup-linux-x64-gnu". Two devDependencies,
# both range-pinned in package.json, so the loss of pinning is negligible.
package-lock.json
